		(property "Description" "RESISTOR, one element on the 0.4 in symbol   Same R1NV0 symbol the RES4 and RES8 arrays drew their elements with, so a part split out of an array keeps the exact symbol, pin span and position it had on the sheet and not one wire has to move. The 0.2 in R-US_SMALL symbol would have shifted both pins by 2.54 mm and stranded every net that touched them."
